  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2020/03/QuioscPrades1.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">A partir de este lunes, 30 de marzo, y mientras dure el estado de alarma, Quiosco Prades, desde El Pla en Onda, ampl&iacute;a el servicio gratuito de reparto a domicilio de la infinidad de art&iacute;culos y productos del establecimiento, sin coste a&ntilde;adido.</span><br />\n <span style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">* Prensa diaria (que ya se viene haciendo normalmente).</span><br style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />\n <span style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">* Revistas</span><br style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\" />\n <span style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">* Crucigramas</span><br />\n <span class=\"text_exposed_show\" style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">* Sopas de letras<br />\n * Sudokus<br />\n * Pan<br />\n * Panpizza<br />\n * Napolitanas de York y queso y de chocolate<br />\n * Xuxos (chocolate y crema)<br />\n * Chucher&iacute;as<br />\n * Refrescos<br />\n * Cerveza<br />\n * Patatas fritas<br />\n * Tabaco<br />\n Y un largo etc.<br />\n Extremar&aacute;n las medidas de seguridad en la entrega<br />\n Para hacer el pedido hay que llamar a los siguientes tel&eacute;fonos:<br />\n Tienda 964 60 16 09 (horario de pedidos de 09:00 a 14:00)<br />\n M&oacute;vil 620725167<br />\n Pedido m&iacute;nimo 3&euro;<br />\n La prensa se continuar&aacute; entregando a primera hora de la ma&ntilde;ana<br />\n Para el resto de pedidos la hora m&aacute;xima de entrega ser&aacute; las 17.00 horas</span></p>\n<p><span class=\"text_exposed_show\" style=\"display: inline; font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">En cuanto al horario del Quiosco Prades mientras dure el estado de alarma es el siguiente:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">De lunes a s&aacute;bado de 8.15 a 14.00 horas</span><br />\n <span style=\"color: rgb(28, 30, 33); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Domingos y festivos de 8.30 a 13.00</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades1.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades1\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades10.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades10\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades11.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades11\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades12.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades12\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades13.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades13\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades14.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades14\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades15.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades15\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades16.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades16\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades17.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades17\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades18.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades18\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades19.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades19\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades2.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades2\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades3.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades3\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades4.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades4\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades5.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades5\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades6.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades6\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades7.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades7\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades8.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades8\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/quioscpradescoronavirus/quioscprades9.jpg\" alt=\"quioscprades9\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
